# AlphoTech CLA v2 — Complete Backend Build

Build the full Node.js/Express backend replacing the current stub scaffold with real service modules, Supabase database, cron automation, webhook handlers, and AI intelligence engine.

## Resolved Decisions

| Question | Decision |
|----------|----------|
| **OpenAI model** | Configurable via `OPENAI_MODEL` env var. Defaults to `gpt-4o-mini`. Switch to `gpt-4o`, `gpt-4-turbo`, or any model by changing one env var. |
| **Supabase** | Full Supabase integration as the real database. SQL migration file included. JSON fallback only when Supabase keys are empty. |
| **Apollo API** | v1 REST API (`api.apollo.io/api/v1/`) — confirmed. |
| **Twitter tiers** | Graceful tier degradation. `TWITTER_TIER` env var (`free`/`basic`/`pro`). Free = post only. Basic = + DMs + analytics. Pro = full access. Features degrade cleanly. |

---

