## Verification Plan

### Automated
1. `npm install` → no errors
2. `npm run dev` → server starts on port 8080
3. `curl http://localhost:8080/api/warroom/missions` → returns sample missions
4. `curl http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations` → shows all integration statuses
5. Every route returns valid JSON with sample data when no API keys are set

### Manual
- Fill in Supabase keys → verify DB operations work
- Fill in one API key at a time → verify routes switch from sample to live data
- Test cron jobs with `CRON_ENABLED=true`
